<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-008" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-wangcheng" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-wangcheng">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-wangcheng:brother" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-wangcheng:brother:m0000" ref="rlk_lzd_86c">王平子</persName>目<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-wangcheng:brother:m0004" ref="b0c_13f_c3a">太尉</persName>：「阿兄形似道，而神鋒太雋。」<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-wangcheng:brother:m0021" ref="b0c_13f_c3a">太尉</persName>答曰：「誠不如卿落落穆穆。」</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-wangcheng:bie" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-wangcheng:bie:m0000" ref="rlk_lzd_86c">澄</persName>風韻邁達，志氣不群。從兄<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-wangcheng:bie:m0013" ref="48e_04a_3d8">戎</persName>、兄<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-wangcheng:bie:m0016" ref="b0c_13f_c3a">夷甫</persName>，名冠當年。四海人士，一為<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-wangcheng:bie:m0031" ref="rlk_lzd_86c">澄</persName>所題目，則二兄不復措意，云『已經<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-wangcheng:bie:m0048" ref="rlk_lzd_86c">平子</persName>』，其見重如此。是以名聞益盛，天下知與不知，莫不傾注。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-wangcheng:bie:m0077" ref="rlk_lzd_86c">澄</persName>後事跡不逮，朝野失望。及舊遊識見者，猶曰：『當今名士也。』</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-wangcheng:letter" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-wangcheng:letter:m0000" ref="rlk_lzd_86c">王平子</persName>與人書，稱其兒：「風氣日上，足散人懷。」</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-wangcheng:yongjia" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-wangcheng:yongjia:m0000" ref="rlk_lzd_86c">澄</persName>弟四子<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-wangcheng:yongjia:m0004" ref="rlk_lzd_86c_B">微</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-wangcheng:bie-son" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-wangcheng:bie-son:m0000" ref="rlk_lzd_86c_B">微</persName>邁上有父風。</p>
</text>
